Import the C function exit taking an integer, returning void, from the header "stdlib.h".
Procedure quit takes code as integer returns void with no return:
    Call exit with code done.
End procedure.
Procedure choose takes value as integer returns integer:
    If value is greater than 0 then:
        Return value.
    Else:
        Call quit with 3 done.
    End if.
End procedure.
Say Call choose with 7 done.
